 388          //-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 389          //子程序名称:void putsizeimage(unsigned char XSIZE,unsigned YSIZE,
 390          //                             unsigned char code *s)
 391          //功能:在(GXPOS,GYPOS)位置绘制XSIZE列及YISZE行点阵的图形*S(XSIZE仅取8的倍数
